 SECOND SPRINT — HOTFIX (post-G3) before Preview
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

2026-05-23 · Removed 'live' overclaim from seed (commit 70673ce)
  Reason: عسفان pH + water_temp + gateway + controller were seeded
          with source_type='live' while values are synthesized by
          Postgres random()/sine — direct §7 violation
          ("simulated data without simulated badge"). Fix: every seed
          row is now 'simulated'. The 'live' enum is reserved for the
          post-G2 MQTT bridge so any 'live'-badged row in the running
          UI proves a real device, never demo data.
  Affects: scripts/seed-supabase.ts +
           supabase/migrations/20260522000003_*.sql +
           one-shot UPDATE patched the rows already in Supabase.

